  "configuration_id": "config_032",
  "reason": "The current best is config_006 (rna_only, multiprofile, scvi_n200, transformer) at 0.6530 acc. The dominant finding is that multiprofile + scvi_n200 is the strongest RNA pipeline, and resnet50 image-only is very weak (0.21). The key open question is whether adding an image modality to the best RNA pipeline provides any complementary signal. Config_032 is the most direct extension of config_006: it keeps the identical RNA encoder (scvi_n200), profile setting (multiprofile), and aggregation (transformer), and adds resnet50 image features via the simplest fusion (concat). This isolates the effect of multimodal fusion on the proven-best RNA backbone. If it improves over 0.6530, we confirm multimodal helps and can then test imagenet_vit_l in the remaining 3 experiments. If it does not, we learn that resnet50 image adds no value and should pivot to testing the stronger imagenet_vit_l encoder. This is the highest-information single experiment under the remaining budget."
}

